[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:11.54]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:15.34]left a single note and went on their way
[00:21.10]I never got their name until the credits
[00:25.26]now it plays here every single day
[00:29.86]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:32.84]One note at a time
[00:38.90]from people passing through
[00:43.04]a name beside a line
[00:49.90]and part of it is you
[00:54.90]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
